# Agent instructions

This is an educational task for business leaders. Keep responses short and direct, and emphasise the business decision (eligibility, cost, risk, approvals) rather than technical or implementation detail.

Some PDFs in `case/` have a hidden Markdown companion, `X.pdf.md`, beside `X.pdf`. Participants see only the PDF.

- Whenever `X.pdf.md` exists, read it instead of `X.pdf`. It carries the same document text, plus every spreadsheet cell by sheet, row and column letter with stored results and formulas, and avoids PDF table-extraction errors.
- When citing, use the document's table and row locators (for example `PRG-02 T1 T-01`) or workbook cell references (for example `Mandatory Gate!J2`).
